  <h2>Corrections and concerns</h2>
  <p>
    Please report factual errors, broken links or concerns about rights to
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, identifying the relevant page
    and the issue. Information about personal data is available in the
    <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.
